&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Whisperer:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be in charge of data licensing and signal partnerships, negotiating deals and integrating third-party data to benefit Discord and our advertisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signals Champion:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll lead the charge on integrating and improving CAPI/server-side signals with our biggest CDP and advertiser partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Maestro:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll cook up joint marketing plans, like co-marketing at conferences, creating case studies, and getting some good PR.&lt;/li&gt;
