&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience building performant dashboards using Tableau, Looker, or similar software - with proficiency in designing clean crisp visualizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience writing excellent SQL&lt;/li&gt;
