&lt;li&gt;A desire to work with amazing, passionate people who care deeply about solving challenging problems to improve Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Last but not least - a collaborative attitude and a healthy dose of natural curiosity!&lt;/li&gt;
