&lt;li&gt;3+ years of work experience in Privacy or Security engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in at least one general purpose programming language (e.g. Python, Rust, Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working in cloud-based environments (we use Google Cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with concepts and practices such as threat modeling, privacy by design, privacy enhancing technologies, and auditing access to data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy concerns that apply in an industry setting, including consent, deletion, and retention, and a basic understanding of regulations such as GDPR or CCPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
