&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating, monitoring, and maintaining large-scale production systems, especially on Kubernetes and/or in large data domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-time data processing (e.g. Kafka, Spark, or Flink)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building ML models using modern frameworks (e.g. PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying GenAI applications, eval frameworks, or agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing infrastructure costs by designing for efficiency and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
